ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi129: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with 1 edge; e1: B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS degree-3 figure-8 curve; control points (0,0,0),(2.5,5,0),(5,0,0),(7.5,-5,0),(10,0,0); curve self-touches at inflection point (5,0,0) — tangential contact not transverse crossing; FixSelfIntersectingEdge split heuristic assumes transverse crossing IS defect; tangential self-touch cannot be resolved by split logic; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; all EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
